                <p class="comp-body-para">Choosing the right gemstone comes down to your personal style, values, and budget. At Sat Jewels, we believe in helping you make an informed decision:</p>
                <ul style="color: #4b5563; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                    <li><strong>Moissanite:</strong> Composed of silicon carbide, moissanite is celebrated for its incredible durability and extraordinary light performance. It delivers higher refractive brilliance and fire than a diamond at an accessible value.</li>
                    <li><strong>Lab-Grown Diamonds:</strong> Chemically, physically, and optically identical to mined diamonds, lab-created diamonds offer the exact prestige and 10/10 hardness of natural stones while providing a sustainable, eco-friendly, and cost-effective alternative.</li>
                    <li><strong>Natural Diamonds:</strong> Mined from the earth over millions of years, natural diamonds are treasured for their traditional heritage and geological rarity.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="comp-body-para">Whether you prioritize eco-conscious luxury, maximum brilliance, or classic diamond prestige, Sat Jewels offers crafted options tailored to your distinct preferences.</p>
            </div>
